title convolve -- the general signed 3x3 convolution kernel, the general contains the special, GREEN
prompt baton prin recur -- pick up the running thread Lindy-first crux-first, take the next agent-doable lap
think Grounded as Kyri in Radiant Style, read REMEMBER, the double-seat eight-seasons itinerary, and the top of the log index. The Microkernel double-seat leads by Lindy-first crux-first yet its only ungated move is study, so the live green edge is Season G open-media, one green Rye rung per lap.
think Standfast check first: REDS is clean -- rows 80/83/84/85 and every prose note closed, released, or (#75) resting as custody-gated errata (a deep debride is Keaton's hand). No open agent-closable red, so new work is licensed.
think Crux-first on the convolution floor: blur/gaussian SMOOTH, sharpen ENHANCES, edges DETECT -- each a hand-built special case of one idea. The edges log named a general 3x3 kernel and a luminance edge map as siblings. The general kernel is the more DURABLE (a floor emboss, Laplacian, and every custom filter descend from) and the harder-solvable (the crux), so I took it over the smaller luminance map.
think Designed image/convolve.rye: a Kernel3 (nine signed weights, a divisor, a bias), clamp((sum(weight*window) / divisor) + bias) per color channel, alpha carried like edges, window clamped like the blur family, integer-only so deterministic. Bounded weight/divisor/bias each refused by name. Five named kernel constants (identity, box, laplacian, emboss, sharpen) ship as proof, emboss + laplacian as convenience verbs.
think The proof shape the tree favors: the general contains the special. The IDENTITY kernel reproduces the source byte-for-byte; the box mean normalizes (flat 100 stays 100, not 9*100) so the divisor is proven; the emboss centers a flat field on mid-gray 128 so the bias is proven, and a bias of 0 leaves it black; the Laplacian lights a bright point to 255 and darkens neighbors so the signed weights are proven. Sobel edge-magnitude is NOT a single linear convolution (it is the L1 of two kernels), so I did not overclaim byte-for-byte parity with edges/sharpen -- named the honest distinction (this sharpen kernel is the single-window Laplacian sharpen, not the Gaussian unsharp mask).
obs GREEN on the first full metal run, no reds -- the design held because it mirrored the proven edges.rye structure (clamp_axis, clamp_byte, guard-before-allocate, per-channel loop with alpha carried).
obs Scope kept narrow: one new operation (the general normalized-biased weighted-window sum) over qoi, no new blend/codec/color; two convenience verbs are pure pass-throughs. A general NxN kernel, a separable-kernel fast path, and a preserve-vs-convolve-alpha option are the named siblings to grow next.
obs Council rota item 9 -- foundations/20260810-011514_pond-the-application-module.md, the Pond application module: the floor where Grain's bounded modules compose into a running whole a person holds, inheriting the shape of an application host from Gall, isolation discipline from KVM/Qemu, and least-privilege posture from the Rust VMMs, code copied from none. The image family is one of those bounded modules Pond will one day compose into a surface a keeper opens.
